  "body_text": "Sequencing and Molecular Biology Solutions for Research, Environmental Monitoring and Innovation\nSequencing & dPCR\n        LDgenX supports projects requiring sequencing technologies, digital PCR (dPCR), and bioinformatics analyses, delivering tailored solutions from experimental design to data interpretation.\n            Approaches\n        Amplicon Sequencing16S, ITS, COI, 12S, 18S and custom genetic markers.MetagenomicsTaxonomic and functional analysis of biological communities.Whole-Genome Sequencing (WGS)Comprehensive genome analysis.RAD-seq & Custom SNP PanelsPopulation genomics and genotyping applications.Long-Read SequencingOxford Nanopore sequencing for long-read genomic analyses.Digital PCR (dPCR)Ultra-sensitive detection and quantification of target species, pathogens, or genetic variants.\n            Services\n        123456\n            Case Studies\n        \n            Epigenomics of Sparidae\n        \n            Detection of Iconic Mediterranean Species Using dPCR\n        \n            Detection of the Purple Sea Urchin (Paracentrotus lividus)\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
  "metadata_path": "source/en/services__sequencing-dpcr.json"
